#   pl "Yay! Take me on an adventure! *Giggles* I hope we’ll find new fishys!"
    pl "Eba! Me leve numa aventura! *Risos* Espero que encontremos novos peixinhos!"

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc2.rpy:421
translate brazil ch6sc2_4c401d9d:

#   mc "You really love your fishys, huh?"
