translate brazil ch6sc2_9c9f54b2:

#   mc "I’m sorry ladies, it’s been a long day and what I truly desire right now is some rest."
    mc "Me desculpem, meninas, foi um dia longo e o que eu realmente quero agora é descansar."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc2.rpy:6741
translate brazil ch6sc2_de698587:

#   mm1 "Awwhh... here we were hoping you’d turn us into your playthings."
